    "_comments": [
      "AllowMultipleSubtypes: sales extends this entity as an IsA child and a second app will too.",
      "The disjoint default mis-chains silently when two children share the parent key.",
      "AllowRecordMerge is deliberately NOT set here. CK_Entity_AllowRecordMerge requires",
      "AllowDeleteAPI = 1 AND DeleteType = 'Soft', and both parties are hard-delete with no",
      "soft-delete column, so the flag is a schema change rather than a metadata one: a merge is",
      "only allowed where the losing record's deletion can be undone. Enabling it means converting",
      "both entities to soft delete, regenerating their stored procedures, and accepting the new",
      "delete semantics everywhere they are used. That is its own change."
    ],
